        "official_en_sha256": "5fdfaabeb030acb1ed19443abe0aa409600d911f6b8a9d383b12e5350d8dd416"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "まだ構想段階だが……\r\nメカボに追加する技は\r\n「戦闘の常識を覆す」ものにするつもりだ。",
        "official_en": "I’m still workshopping the idea, but...I’m thinking the upgrade will be something that challenges the way we currently do battle.",
        "real_en": "It's still just an idea, but I want his next skill to turn everything we know about battle on its head."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
