        "official_en_sha256": "aa13275aff72913d8968f74b44f805fc2c4bfc06d7080b8d38d30bc13d0f70a4"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "もっとお前の力になりたい。\r\nメカボからそんな声が聞こえた気がしたからな。",
        "official_en": "Yes. Call it a hunch, but when I was working on him...it felt like he was trying to tell me that he always wished he could do more for you.",
        "real_en": "It felt as though I could hear Mechabo saying he wanted to be more help to you."
      },
